<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">In the era of ever-rising cloud computing costs, we're excited to introduce Intel</span></span>®<span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black"> Granulate</span></span>™&nbsp;<span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">—designed to help you and your business get more from your Big Data infrastructure with real-time, autonomous optimization.&nbsp; </span></span><br />
<span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif">Intel Granulate</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">helps you maximize your Data Analytics cloud and workload efficiency:</span></span></span></span></span>
<ul>
	<li style="margin-left:16px; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">AI/ML based efficiency: </span></span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Intelligently designed algorithm delivers up to 45% CPU/Memory efficiency to Spark based workloads without requiring Application Teams to conduct laborious development work.&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:16px; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Quick time to value: </span></span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Determine ROI of the free POC within hours.&nbsp; Full production optimization efficiency impact within weeks.&nbsp; Have the all the data you need prior to spending a single dollar.&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Past initiative agnostic</span></span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">: Application/Orchestration level optimizations from Granulate for your Big Data workloads are additive to all previous optimization initiatives, bringing additive value to you on-prem and cloud-based deployments.&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Check out the attached IT@Intel Solution Brief to see the value Intel found internally with Intel Granulate on our Big Data deployment. And if you’d like to find out how organizations like yours have been able to <b>cut cloud costs and improve capacity by an average of 30%</b> with improved performance on a more efficient infrastructure</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;If this is something that would benefit you it'd be great to have a call to discuss.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Hope you have a great week!</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:&quot;Intel Clear Wvi&quot;,serif"><span style="color:black">Sincerely,</span></span><br />
